1086
00:56:23,740 --> 00:56:27,020
成绩出来了，1分21，1分22。
Here comes the time, 1.21, 1.22.

1087
00:56:27,060 --> 00:56:29,340
1分22。
克拉克森：嘘……
1.22.
CLARKSON: Shh...

1088
00:56:31,220 --> 00:56:33,420
太神了！这表现牛不牛？
Fantastic! How good was that?

1089
00:56:33,460 --> 00:56:36,300
一辆在自家棚屋里就能攒出来的两万镑车，
A £20,000 car you can build in your shed,

1090
00:56:36,340 --> 00:56:38,020
听好了，是在自家棚子里啊，伙计们！
that's in your shed, guys!

1091
00:56:38,060 --> 00:56:39,340
干掉了风之子Zonda。
Beat the Zonda.

1092
00:56:39,380 --> 00:56:40,740
所以我要把它贴上榜了。
So I'm going to put that on here.

1093
00:56:40,780 --> 00:56:43,500
XTR……
- 成绩到底是多少？
XTR...
- What was it?

1094
00:56:43,540 --> 00:56:49,100
是1分22秒6，我四舍五入
算它1分23吧。
It was 1.22.6, I'm going to round it up
to 1.23.

1095
00:56:49,140 --> 00:56:53,700
Zonda跑了1分23整。
那这车直接登顶了。
The Zonda did it in 1.23.
That goes on the top.

1096
00:56:53,740 --> 00:56:57,340
这就是最快的车了，
Westfield做到了！
That is the quickest car,
the Westfield did it.

1097
00:56:57,380 --> 00:57:01,500
伴随着这个重磅炸弹，我们……
- 噢别！
先别急着结语，杰里米。
On that bombshell, we...
- Ooh no!
Before you do that, Jeremy.

1098
00:57:01,540 --> 00:57:06,540
有件要紧事。
还记得跟设计师在一起时，
杰里米给我们画的那张图吗？
Important thing.
Remember with the designers,
Jeremy did his drawing for us?

1099
00:57:06,580 --> 00:57:08,540
哎，我都给忘了。
Oh, I'd forgotten about it.

1100
00:57:08,580 --> 00:57:11,300
大家想想，这家伙这几个世纪以来
开过多少辆车啊。
Bear in mind how many cars
this man's driven over the centuries.

1101
00:57:11,340 --> 00:57:13,780
咱们来瞧瞧这幅大作。
- 我还是开车更在行。
Let's have a look at this.
- I am better at driving.

1102
00:57:13,820 --> 00:57:16,140
来看看。
给大家瞧瞧……这……
Let's have a look.
Show everyone... That...

1103
00:57:18,540 --> 00:57:21,700
我觉得挺好的啊，唯一的毛病就是
我把轮子给画崩了。
I mean, it is good. The only problem was
my wheels went wrong.

1104
00:57:21,740 --> 00:57:24,740
哈蒙德：简直惨不忍睹。
- 咱们把它寄给现代吧。
HAMMOND: Pathetic.
- We'll send it to Hyundai.

1105
00:57:24,780 --> 00:57:29,220
这就是他们的下一代新车了。
- 他们肯定巴不得抢过去。
That's their next new model.
- They'd bite your arm off.

1106
00:57:29,260 --> 00:57:32,740
呃，跟你们剧透下周节目完全没意义，
Um, there's no point telling you what's in
next week's show

1107
00:57:32,780 --> 00:57:34,900
因为我们总在最后一刻变卦，
'cause we always change our mind
last minute,

1108
00:57:34,940 --> 00:57:37,340
但可以向大家保证的是，
肯定少不了这个：
but you can be assured,
there'll be some of this:

1109
00:57:40,580 --> 00:57:45,340
那就是阿斯顿·马丁Vanquish
对决法拉利575，
That's the Aston Martin Vanquish
versus the Ferrari 575

1110
00:57:45,380 --> 00:57:48,540
而且还是带Fiorano操控套件的版本。
千万别错过。
with the Fiorano handling pack
on it. Don't miss it.

1111
00:57:48,580 --> 00:57:49,660
晚安！
Night!

1112
00:57:49,684 --> 00:57:54,684
